      "text": "One message saying \" Tala, Tala, Tala\" can end a marriage- is technology empowering people or taking women's rights away ?",
      "likeCount": 3,
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-06T09:24:18Z",
      "replyCount": 1,
      "replies": [
        {
          "id": "UgwvKb95J3-E3msGbjJ4AaABAg.AaPi9_vQT0bAaTxIEUkPTG",
          "author": "@EpicWorldDiscoveries-m2g",
          "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/Vl9SE1kH8aqb9O8z4ldYJc-hEKfQq-IoGMCnuuRts5gzyGy2MCK71Bbdux53Q2XII9Akr5w2PE4=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
          "text": "Technology can do both. It can give women access to information, legal assistance and supportive communities, but it can also make abandonment frighteningly easy. A message should never erase someone’s right to due process, financial protection and dignity.",
          "likeCount": 0,
          "publishedAt": "2026-09-08T00:53:31Z"
        }
      ]
    },
